    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD-ROM contains copies of the navigation and field sidescan sonar data collected during R/V CAPE HENLOPEN cruise 94-12. The cruise was conducted during 24-30 May, 1994, and was a collaborative field program between researchers at the University of Delaware and the USGS, Marine and Coastal Geology Program, Northeast Section. The study area is the site of a long-term ecological and oceanographic study that researchers at Rutgers University are conducting.\"",
